Kiwi dual simplex 기반 제약 솔버.\n\n사용:\n co:
Constraint solver based on Kiwi dual simplex.

Usage:
  const solver = new LayoutSolver();
  const x = new LayoutVariable("x");
  const y = new LayoutVariable("y");
  solver.addConstraint(LayoutExpression.fromVariable(x).equalTo(10));
  solver.addConstraint(LayoutExpression.fromVariable(y).equalTo(
      LayoutExpression.fromVariable(x).add(20)
  ));
  solver.updateVariables();
  x.getValue(); // 10
  y.getValue(); // 30

Dynamic input (drag, etc):
  solver.addEditVariable(x, LayoutStrength.strong);
  solver.suggestValue(x, 50);
  solver.updateVariables();

대사 진행기.\n- {speaker, text} 대사와 선택지 / 라벨:
Dialogue runner.
- Interprets in order a script made of {speaker, text} lines and choices / labels / jumps.
  Standardizes the state machine that visual novels / RPG dialogues / tutorials each built.
- Script entry format:
    { speaker: "name", text: "line" }
    { label: "tag" }
    { jump: "tag" }
    { choice: [{ text: "option", jump: "tag" }, ...] }
    { end: true }
- Usage:
    runner.setScript(entries); runner.start();
    runner.getCurrent()   → { kind: "line" | "choice" | "finished", ... }
    runner.advance() on a line, runner.choose(index) on a choice.

드래그 가능 컴포넌트.\n- 노드에 붙이면 눌러서 끌 수 있다. 놓으면:
Draggable component.
- Attached to a node, it can be pressed and dragged. On release it notifies via dragEndEvent, and
  if setSnapBackEnabled(true), it slides back to where it was before being grabbed.
- The movement adds the view coordinate delta directly to the local position.
  (sensitivity may differ if an ancestor node has a scale)
- Usage:
    const draggable = cardNode.addComponent(UIDraggable);
    draggable.setSnapBackEnabled(true);
    draggable.setDragEndEvent((self, viewPosition) => { ... });

드롭다운. (콤보박스)\n- 닫힌 머리 단추에 현재 값이 보이고, 누르면:
Dropdown. (combo box)
- The closed header button shows the current value, and pressing it expands the option list downward.
- Usage:
    const dropdown = new UIDropdown({ width: 180, height: 30 });
    dropdown.setOptionList(["Dark", "Light", "System"]);
    dropdown.setChangedEvent((self) => { self.getSelectedText(); });
    panelNode.addChild(dropdown);

떠오르는 텍스트 관리 노드. (데미지 숫자 / +코인 등)\n- spaw:
Floating text manager node. (damage numbers / +coins, etc.)
- Text shown with spawn() floats upward and fades out. Finished label nodes are reused.
- Add it to the scene root with addChild and spawn in world coordinates.
- Usage:
    const floatingText = new FloatingText();
    scene.getRoot().addChild(floatingText);
    floatingText.spawn("-120", position, { color: new Color(1, 0.4, 0.4, 1) });

라인 차트.\n- 값 배열을 노드 영역에 폴리라인으로 그린다. pushV:
Line chart.
- Draws a value array as a polyline in the node area. Pushing new values with pushValue every frame / every second
  makes it a real-time graph where old values are pushed out.
- Usage:
    const lineChart = chartNode.addComponent(UILineChart);
    lineChart.setMaxSampleCount(60);
    every second: lineChart.pushValue(newValue);

로컬라이제이션.\n- 언어 자동 감지 + 번역 테이블 + {0}{1} 자:
Localization.
- Gathers automatic language detection + translation tables + {0}{1} placeholder substitution + fallback in one place.
- Keys may be the source text as is. If missing from the table, the source text (key) is returned as is, so translation can be gradual.
  Usage example:
    Localization.setTable("en", { "Confirm": "OK", "{0} points earned": "Got {0} points" });
    Localization.setLanguage(Localization.detectLanguage(["ko", "en"]));
    Localization.text("{0} points earned", 120);
- Matches a language tag by dropping trailing subtags one at a time, and also checks aliases. (setLanguageAliases)
- For a right-to-left language (isRightToLeft, setRightToLeft), mirrors the layout (mirrorLayoutX, readLayoutTextAlign),
  and wraps values inserted in text with directional isolate characters. (isolateText, the "{name}" placeholders of textNamed, values joined only by slashes are wrapped once as a whole)

상태 등록.\n- handlers: { enter?, tick?, exi:
Registers a state.
- handlers: { enter?, tick?, exit? }
  enter(previousStateName), tick(timeDelta, stateSeconds), exit(nextStateName)

셰이더 스프라이트 컴포넌트.\n- Sprite 와 같지만 프래그먼트 셰이:
Shader sprite component.
- Same as Sprite but applies fragment shader effects (dissolve / flash / outline / hologram / ripple / mosaic / glitch / shine / silhouette / grayscale / hue rotation / wipe / iris / chromatic aberration).
- The effect time advances on its own (tick), and the progress is pushed in by tweens / timelines.
- Usage:
    const sprite = node.addComponent(ShaderSprite);
    sprite.setImage(image);
    sprite.setEffect(ShaderSpriteEffect.dissolve);
    sprite.setEffectProgress(0.5);

스프라이트 애니메이터 컴포넌트.\n- 이름을 붙인 클립(프레임 시퀀스)을:
Sprite animator component.
- Registers named clips (frame sequences) and switches with play("run").
- Playing the same clip again does not restart it. (can be changed with the restartIfSame option)
- When a clip ends, the next state can follow via the onComplete callback. (combines with an FSM)
- Applies the current frame (image + rect) to the Sprite component on the same node.
- Usage:
    const animator = node.addComponent(SpriteAnimator);
    animator.addClip("idle", image, idleRects, 10, true);
    animator.addClip("attack", image, attackRects, 12, false);
    animator.play("attack", { onComplete: () => animator.play("idle") });

애셋 함께 받기.\n- 그림, JSON, 글, 바이너리, 소리, 글꼴,:
Loads assets together.
- Adds images, JSON, text, binary, sounds, fonts and custom loads (addTask) to the list and loads them all at once with load().
  The number of concurrent loads is set with setConcurrency. (Waiting for each one in turn delays loading and decoding in a queue)
- Failed ones also count as finished, so it does not stop. Failures remain in getFailedList() as { path, error }.
- Progress is finished count / total count. (getProgress, loaded count getLoadedCount, finished count getFinishedCount, total getTotalCount)
  Calls the function set with setProgressHandler on every change, and the function set with setCompleteHandler when everything is done.
- Items added while loading are also loaded by the same load. (If fewer workers are running than the concurrency, launches that many more) To add more after everything is done, call load() again.
- Usage:
    const assetLoader = new AssetLoader();
    assetLoader.setConcurrency(8);
    const titleImageAsset = assetLoader.addImage("assets/title.png");
    const stageJsonAsset = assetLoader.addJson("assets/stage.json");
    gameScene.trackAssetLoader(assetLoader);     // GameScene loading bar follows the progress
    await assetLoader.load();

액션.\n- 순차적으로 스텝을 실행하는 스크립팅 방식의 액션 클래스.\n:
Action.
- A scripting-style action class that runs steps sequentially.
- Usage example:
    const action = new Action()
        .wait(1.0, {
            started:   (target) => { },
            updated:   (progress, target) => { target.setLocalOpacity(progress); },
            completed: (target) => { }
        })
        .condition((target) => gameState.isReady())
        .call((target) => { target.playAnimation(); })
        .repeat(3, new Action().wait(0.5, { updated: (p, t) => { ... } }))
        .forever(new Action().wait(2.0));

    action.start(myNode);

    // Every frame:
    action.step(timeDelta);

